OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1787064555
OL,3,CBat rescued after getting stuck in
OL,4,Ctoilet in Sussex
OL,6,FA bat which stranded itself in a
OL,7,Ftoilet in Sussex has been safely
OL,8,Frehabilitated.
OL,10,FNicknamed 'Louis' by his rescuers, the
OL,11,FSerotine bat was found floating in a
OL,12,Floo earlier this month.
OL,14,FThe bat was swiftly fished out of the
OL,15,Ftoilet with a trowel, and popped
OL,16,Fsomeone safe to dry out.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
