PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1787064555
OL,3,CBat rescued after getting stuck in
OL,4,Ctoilet in Sussex
OL,6,FHowever his rescuers say he looked
OL,7,F'very sorry for himself', so they
OL,8,Fdrafted in expert advice from Sussex
OL,9,FWildlife Trust, who referred them to
OL,10,FSussex Bat Group.
OL,12,FThey were advised to take him to 'bat
OL,13,Fhospital', which they promptly did,
OL,14,Fand his recovery began.
OL,16,FAfter a week of good food, water and
OL,17,Fspace to fly, Louis was deemed fit to
OL,18,Freturn home by the charity.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
