OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1787064555
OL,3,CBat rescued after getting stuck in
OL,4,Ctoilet in Sussex
OL,6,FHe was driven back by a volunteer
OL,7,Fambulance driver, and released back
OL,8,Finto the garden of the house he was
OL,9,Ffound in.
OL,11,FLouis was said to 'pose' for a
OL,12,Fpicture, before flying off into the
OL,13,Fnight, this time away from the toilet
OL,14,Fhe had become trapped in.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/3
